X:1
T:Every Little Thing She Does Is Magic
C:Sting (The Police)
M:4/4
O:England, 1981
N:Opening section and first verse. Melody from channel 3 (the vocal line) of a hamienet.com MIDI arrangement (track 325119590687453); chords from its bass and arpeggio channels, which hold one pad (G A E D) over a rising bass G A B C#, so the symbols follow the bass. Transposed up a minor third from D major to F major so the range is C4 to C5. Held notes are rounded to notatable values: the long note in bar 4 runs a sixteenth longer, the one tied over bars 7 and 8 a sixteenth longer, and the final held note is cut to three beats. The last bar is short to pay back the opening pickup. Humanized onsets snapped to the sixteenth grid.
N:Notated at double note values (quarters/eighths instead of eighths/sixteenths); the sounding tempo is unchanged
